    BOXES --> SOLUTION
    SOLUTION --> ECON
    SOLUTION -.-> ROBOT
  end

  subgraph FEEDBACK["G. Audit and improvement loop"]
    LEDGER["Versioned shared ledger<br/>commit refs · test results · status · costs"]
    METRICS["Measure accepted throughput<br/>latency · tokens · rework · mismatch · review cost"]
    UPDATE["Reviewed repository update / PR"]
    LEDGER --> METRICS --> UPDATE --> CORPUS
  end

